+   - Specify the **State Name** (e.g. `In Review`).
+   - Assign the **Lifecycle Group** (`started` for active work, `completed` for resolved work).
+   - Choose a distinct **Accent Color**.
+   - Check **Make Default** if newly created tickets should land in this column.
+4. **Configure WIP Limits:**
+   - Enter a **Soft WIP Limit** (e.g. `4`) to flag column congestion during daily standups.
+   - Enter a **Hard WIP Limit** (e.g. `6`) if your team enforces strict pull-based flow and prohibits card overloading.
+   - Verify that `wip_soft_limit <= wip_hard_limit`.
+5. **Reorder Board Columns:** Drag states up and down using the grip handle to adjust their execution sort order from left to right.
+6. **Save Changes:** Click **`Save States`** to persist the configuration. Board columns update immediately across all connected WebSockets.
 
